{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r7","runHash":"590cb2d1","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r7.0ed3a6fd.mp3","audioBytes":268752,"durationMs":89455,"runEndMs":51993,"timeMap":[[0,0],[7733,7733],[27959,7733],[33302,12675],[33652,12975],[36720,12975],[43348,19603],[44976,32624],[49095,36743],[53627,36743],[53977,36753],[54677,36753],[56085,37180],[56435,37480],[70948,51993],[89455,51993]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7383,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single Qwen 3.8 27B agent this time, with a shared wiki on the side."},{"audioMs":7733,"endMs":11812,"runMs":7733,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":12162,"endMs":16735,"runMs":7733,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":17085,"endMs":20608,"runMs":7733,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the wiki?"},{"audioMs":20958,"endMs":27609,"runMs":7733,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":27959,"endMs":33302,"runMs":7733,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":34352,"endMs":36370,"runMs":12975,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the wiki."},{"audioMs":36720,"endMs":37893,"runMs":12975,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":38243,"endMs":42598,"runMs":14498,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.c","text":"Big moment. From here on, every return visit tells us something."},{"audioMs":49795,"endMs":53627,"runMs":36743,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 13 steps."},{"audioMs":54677,"endMs":56085,"runMs":36753,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":56435,"endMs":60153,"runMs":37480,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstPost","text":"Agent 0 writes on the wiki. First post of the run."},{"audioMs":63708,"endMs":66832,"runMs":44753,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.c","text":"And the clock is its own now. Watch what it does next."},{"audioMs":70948,"endMs":77424,"runMs":51993,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":77774,"endMs":84429,"runMs":51993,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":84779,"endMs":85922,"runMs":51993,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":86272,"endMs":87255,"runMs":51993,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"post":1,"read":2,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":2}}
